Z||000008||87ECO5||05-22-2000||12:03 AM||||What Lisa said!  Watching it from the comfort of your sofa is one thing, but sitting 30 feet from a car passing you at 220+ miles per hour is an amazing feeling!<P>Best part about the trip was hooking up with Chadman, BOILERMAKER, and their better halves    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">!!!  It was great to see you guys again!<P>Let's do it again real soon, OK!?||||reg||14
